SUMMARY:The Fleok | Kai Weinkauf | The Guns
LOCATION:Bowery Palace\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:The Fleok is a NYC-based collective that records indie and alte
 
rnative rock designed to emulate the energy of their live shows. Joining th
 
em is Kai Weinkauf\, whose music combines the emotional lyricism of a singe
 
r-songwriter with the energy\, fervor\, and creativity of cutting-edge indi
 
e rock. Fresh off the release of their second EP\, \, "rdquo" -> Now"\, Kai
 
 and his four-piece band blend driving experimental rock riffs with infecti
 
ous indie pop and heartfelt ballads. They are set to begin rolling out thei
 
r first full-length LP later this year. AND The Guns represents a new wave 
 
of grunge with a psychedelic motif. Songwriting by New York natives Hunter 
 
Lyons\, Martín Marraccino\, Dan Vitenko\, and Joshua Fisher pushes the bou
 
ndaries of NYC's underground. Profound lyrics are accompanied by ethereal i
 
nstrumentation (they play some covers too). Tickets & info: https://www.tic
 
ketweb.com/event/the-fleok-kai-weinkauf-bowery-palace-tickets/14359024
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-fleok-kai-weinkauf-bowery-palace-ti
 
ckets/14359024
END:VEVENT
