SUMMARY:Maiden King | Lora Mouna | Ellis's World
LOCATION:Berlin\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:Lora Mouna uses music as a vessel to capture moments of vulnera
 
bility within herself and her relationships. Her music reflects on her shad
 
ow work and healing\, flowing between indie-rock\, folk\, and Middle Easter
 
n music - intertwining the different sonic experiences from her culture and
 
 inspirations. Maiden King uses music as a vessel to explore the inner and 
 
outer worlds that constitute who we are. These songs revel in the complexit
 
ies and nuances of very simple seeds and relish in the unfolding of a story
 
 that never ends. It is energetic\, questioning rock music with flourishes 
 
of americana\, cinematic orchestrations and textured ambient music. Ellis's
 
 World uses music as a vessel to compliment the quiet but brilliant reflect
 
ions that can punctuate and permeate a slowly unfurling afternoon. The perf
 
ect kind of porch sittin'\, three chord strummin'\, beer sippin' afternoons
 
 that linger well past sunset. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/ev
 
ent/maiden-king-lora-mouna-berlin-tickets/14358934
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/maiden-king-lora-mouna-berlin-tickets/1
 
4358934
